    "A hand-built three-segment merged JSON, small enough to reason about by hand and complete enough that every timing producer runs on it with no models and no real audio.",
    "TIME CONVENTIONS, which are what this fixture exists to pin down (backend/timing.py module docstring):",
    "  segments[].start/end, segments[].words[].start/end  ABSOLUTE seconds on the source timeline.",
    "  segments[].tts_words[].start/end                    CLIP-RELATIVE seconds: 0.0 is the first sample of that segment's raw TTS clip.",
    "They are deliberately NOT interchangeable here: every segment's tts_words[] start at or near 0.0 while its words[] start at the segment's absolute slot offset, so a producer that confuses the two produces placements that are off by whole segments and the test notices.",
