    "SEG_0000 has two source speech runs split by a 0.70 s pause and a matching gap in tts_words[]: the pause-aware / word-anchored path.",
    "SEG_0001 has one run (all internal gaps < pause_min_s): the degenerate single-piece path.",
    "SEG_0002 has three runs and a raw clip LONGER than its speech budget, so the tempo cap gets hit: the overrun path."
